<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50695" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππ-ειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of a horse</i> or
				<i>horses</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζυγόν, φάτνη</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.799
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10.568
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάπαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.40
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵ. λόφος</span>
			<i>horse-hair</i> crest, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.537
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔντεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					9.22
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γένος, μάνδραι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				341
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				659.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔθειραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					16.81
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἵππειον [γάλα</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				522a28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Posidon.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.712
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλω ἱππείω δύο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12.330.19
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-είως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					58
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππειος, ὁ</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήν</span>), name of month at Thronion, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Klio</u>
				16.176
			</span></i> (Delph.). (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππιος</span> is the
			usual form in Trag., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππικός</span> in
			Prose.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
